{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 少数音乐术语（如“F小调”“八度”“装饰音”）对普通观众不够直观，Y 的白话感受词更容易即时理解。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 用【】突出每段叙事的关键转折和心理判断，感受文字又随音乐进程出现，观众更容易在听音乐的同时抓住重点，不必在一大堆短词中自行寻找关系。它不仅交代人物舍不得什么、为什么矛盾，还把情绪变化与具体的音乐动作、音色和节奏联系起来，前后形成了从留恋、挣扎到接纳的连续过程。Y 的叙事本身也清楚，但右侧感受词经常集中堆叠，彼此的先后、层次和音乐对应关系不如 X 容易把握。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "87ead417-2059-46ca-bd63-c08c442f088b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T002449963952Z", "elapsed_seconds": 68.094, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:25:58.079237+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a245029c540e65446db43839d62f017223b73d3a939ec8fac5cfeb24d597abbe", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web